variable C5${dir} equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(743.22125569036+${C5pos})
variable C51 equal 0.5*(743.22125569036+-743.31574321865)
